@startuml
actor HR
participant FE
participant NotifSvc
participant ApplicantSvc
database DB


HR -> FE : Tạo nội dung + chọn mẫu
FE -> ApplicantSvc : queryRecipients(filters) ' sync
ApplicantSvc -> DB : SELECT candidates by filters ' sync
DB --> ApplicantSvc : recipients
ApplicantSvc --> FE : recipients ' reply
HR -> FE : Gửi
FE -> NotifSvc : sendTo(recipients,payload) ' sync (enqueue)
NotifSvc ->> NotifSvc : enqueueBatch(recipients) ' SELF + ASYNC dispatch
NotifSvc -> DB : INSERT notification logs (batch) ' sync
DB --> NotifSvc : ok
NotifSvc --> FE : result(summary) ' reply
@enduml